# Exploratory animation tuning. frontend/scripts is an experiment bench: dozens
# of one-off probes and parameter searches live there and were never meant to be
# versioned, while a handful of tools are called by the build, the docs or the
# visual tests. Track the exceptions instead of chasing prefixes, so a new
# experiment is ignored by default. Promote a keeper with `git add -f <path>`, or
# add a `!` line below if it should stay visible for everyone.
frontend/scripts/*
!frontend/scripts/make-favicon.py
!frontend/scripts/make-og-image.py
!frontend/scripts/pose-sheet.mjs
!frontend/scripts/probe-cast.mjs
!frontend/scripts/probe-catcher.mjs
!frontend/scripts/probe-fielding.mjs

# Throwaway artefacts from that work: silhouette/debug helpers, captured diffs,
# render dumps, and scratch dataset pulls beside the backend.
.ps-view/
.pitchshots-view/
frontend/_*.mjs
frontend/__*.py
frontend/src/util/*.patch
frontend/src/util/tmp*.js
backend/scratch_*

# Ad-hoc Playwright stills captured into the harness (committed baselines live in
# frontend/e2e/__screenshots__)
frontend/e2e/stills/

# Blender autosave/backup files
*.blend1
*.blend2
*.blend3
*.blend.tmp

# IDE / local libs
.local_libs/
.idea/
